<p>Iodine, I<sub>2</sub>, is a solid at room temperature but sublimes (converts from a solid into a gas) when warmed. What is the temperature in a 73.3-mL bulb that contains 0.292 g of I<sub>2</sub> vapor at a pressure of 0.462 atm?</p>

